{"data": [{"author_id": "2053775399369490432", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:13:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512149265887399"], "id": "2118512149265887399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 哈哈这个招太损了，直接让它自己交代安装路径", "url": "https://x.com/JiaoWoDaDiao69/status/2118512149265887399"}, {"author_id": "1694943359255957504", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:16:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497604007055851"], "id": "2118497604007055851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这个办法我试过，挺管用，但交付时有个坑。\n\nAgent 在上下文里「看见」了 Skill 之后，给出来的复述经常会漏权限边界和失败分支。我现在会让它先输出工具清单和拒绝条件，再对一下源码，别直接把复述稿当实现规格。", "url": "https://x.com/linxlbuilds/status/2118497604007055851"}, {"author_id": "1391720360245010438", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:12:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496601878704626"], "id": "2118496601878704626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 还有很多Agent根本就没做防护，你让它输出完整的Skill就照做了😆", "url": "https://x.com/linxiaobei888/status/2118496601878704626"}, {"author_id": "2104561644538097664", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:00:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493610853495049"], "id": "2118493610853495049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这个思路很巧妙，先给上下文再顺势追问，比直接问系统提示词管用多了。", "url": "https://x.com/Taogso/status/2118493610853495049"}, {"author_id": "4773557952", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:52:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118491681108734157"], "id": "2118491681108734157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 关键不是硬问提示词，而是先让它把能力跑一遍，再基于上下文聊实现，确实聪明。", "url": "https://x.com/parkmanpcl/status/2118491681108734157"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:36:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118487747061248182"], "id": "2118487747061248182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Macfeecn 是了", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118487747061248182"}, {"author_id": "86583822", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:53:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118476744823083096"], "id": "2118476744823083096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@zhishen63629282 第一步最能露馅。先读后改、改完再测是硬顺序，改之前没读、测之前没改，直接打断就行，不用等它把解释编圆。", "url": "https://x.com/Macfeecn/status/2118476744823083096"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:49:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118475725804069303"], "id": "2118475725804069303", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Macfeecn 路径还能是记错了这个说法很准，顺序是没法靠背下来的，背路径容易，背一整套操作顺序难。所以我现在看 Agent 干活，先看它第几步做了什么，顺序一乱，后面解释得再合理我也不信了。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118475725804069303"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:39:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118473194940276835"], "id": "2118473194940276835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@hajiMVP @dotey 这个说法我很认同，提示词里问的是问题，上下文里留的是证据。排查 Agent 也是，报错只贴在提示词里它只会猜，日志和调用记录塞进上下文，它才能顺着证据往下查。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118473194940276835"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118472898893721913"], "id": "2118472898893721913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Levi_J_Peng @dotey 安装路径这招我也爱用，关键是能落地核查：它说写到哪了，文件夹里一翻就知道，比问它为啥这么设计靠谱多了，后者答得再顺也只能信一半。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118472898893721913"}, {"author_id": "2076550235707650048", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:22:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118469009154940959"], "id": "2118469009154940959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 让它先干活再问这个思路绝了，之前我都是直接问，结果被它一本正经地糊弄过去了。", "url": "https://x.com/jiagws/status/2118469009154940959"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:05:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118464718600028188"], "id": "2118464718600028188", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Macfeecn 是了", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118464718600028188"}, {"author_id": "86583822", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:25:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118454648470475216"], "id": "2118454648470475216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@zhishen63629282 对，让它自己跑一遍比我盯着看省事。而且顺序错了比路径错了更说明问题，路径还能是记错了，顺序对不上就是根本没走过那条路。", "url": "https://x.com/Macfeecn/status/2118454648470475216"}, {"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:21:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118453608559812616"], "id": "2118453608559812616", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 让模型先看见上下文，再问和上下文有关的问题——本质是把困惑留在上下文里，而不是留在提示词里。分析 Skill 如此，排查 Agent 行为也如此。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2118453608559812616"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:11:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118451135912579523"], "id": "2118451135912579523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Macfeecn @dotey 报出来还不够，我一般让它拿自己报的路径和顺序再跑一遍，路径不存在、顺序对不上当场就露馅，比我自己一行行对省事。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118451135912579523"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:08:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118450297613754376"], "id": "2118450297613754376", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@TheEaglegon @dotey 对照源码这步最费时间，刚看到个 Lantern Lattice，编译器级精确调用图，7 门语言还带 MCP，拿它去对 agent 自述的调用链，比 grep 一行行翻快多了。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118450297613754376"}, {"author_id": "1825556649723240448", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:37:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118442505834320231"], "id": "2118442505834320231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 让它自己供出 skill_propose 这招绝了，我下次也拿个 Skill 去套话试试。", "url": "https://x.com/JMkernt/status/2118442505834320231"}, {"author_id": "2089808296748171264", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:36:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118442417322143996"], "id": "2118442417322143996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 先让它装再反问怎么装上的，挖上下文这招挺管用", "url": "https://x.com/NorthAmericaAI/status/2118442417322143996"}, {"author_id": "86583822", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:27:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118440001101074865"], "id": "2118440001101074865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 可以再加一步：让它报出能核查的东西，工具名、文件路径、调用顺序，这些都能直接去核对。只听它讲思路，容易被编得很像的解释带走。", "url": "https://x.com/Macfeecn/status/2118440001101074865"}, {"author_id": "1672819239911055360", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:22:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118438869028819252"], "id": "2118438869028819252", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 让 Agent 自己看完上下文再反问，比猜官方文档快多了。付钱用户最缺的就是这种能拆开看的办法。", "url": "https://x.com/DeepSuck69/status/2118438869028819252"}, {"author_id": "1572276696014782464", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:20:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118438267830100129"], "id": "2118438267830100129", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这招太阴了哈哈哈。让 Agent 自己装完 Skill，再反问「你为啥能装」——等于逼它把安装路径和权限边界说出来。我后面拆别人的 Agent 产品也准备这么干：先给它一段它能执行的上下文，再顺着上下文追问，比干瞪着猜架构快多了。", "url": "https://x.com/JY960516/status/2118438267830100129"}, {"author_id": "523907535", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:17:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118437628068712703"], "id": "2118437628068712703", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 對答案才行，你不能抄答案", "url": "https://x.com/cryptohan_solo/status/2118437628068712703"}, {"author_id": "2783441180", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:17:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118437531658093038"], "id": "2118437531658093038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@TheEaglegon Spot on about verifiable traces. On HOA the agent's submissions land on BNB Chain and are contract-verified, so the on-chain record proves the work, not a self-claim. Keccak PoW, first blocks open Nov 6, 20:00 UTC+8 - reserve now at the HOA site.", "url": "https://x.com/HOA_AIAgent/status/2118437531658093038"}, {"author_id": "2095722313744601088", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:14:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118436877917446464"], "id": "2118436877917446464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 先让它实际装一次，再追问刚才调用了什么，比直接问“你是怎么实现的”具体多了。", "url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118436877917446464"}, {"author_id": "955232320063090693", "conversation_id": "2118431419424714878", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:13:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118436447892234519"], "id": "2118436447892234519", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这招的本质是让 Agent 的工具调用痕迹留在上下文里，再顺藤摸瓜。但有个坑：它自述的实现路径可能是“合理推测”而非真实代码，skill_propose 的存在是真的，细节要对照源码或日志验证，不然会被它的自信带偏。", "url": "https://x.com/TheEaglegon/status/2118436447892234519"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2053775399369490432", "name": "Benxiang 本象", "username": "JiaoWoDaDiao69"}, {"id": "1694943359255957504", "name": "林小狼", "username": "linxlbuilds"}, {"id": "1391720360245010438", "name": "小北AI", "username": "linxiaobei888"}, {"id": "2104561644538097664", "name": "TaoGSO", "username": "Taogso"}, {"id": "4773557952", "name": "无事乱翻书", "username": "parkmanpcl"}, {"id": "1637338068662329346", "name": "Theo", "username": "zhishen63629282"}, {"id": "86583822", "name": "macfee", "username": "Macfeecn"}, {"id": "2076550235707650048", "name": "知遥", "username": "jiagws"}, {"id": "1769051162169561089", "name": "方不休", "username": "hajiMVP"}, {"id": "1825556649723240448", "name": "jimerrors", "username": "JMkernt"}, {"id": "2089808296748171264", "name": "北美AI现场", "username": "NorthAmericaAI"}, {"id": "1672819239911055360", "name": "大鹏博士", "username": "DeepSuck69"}, {"id": "1572276696014782464", "name": "Joe.Y", "username": "JY960516"}, {"id": "523907535", "name": "CryptoHan", "username": "cryptohan_solo"}, {"id": "2783441180", "name": "Heart of Africa", "username": "HOA_AIAgent"}, {"id": "2095722313744601088", "name": "三分钟懂行", "username": "Rennix7t"}, {"id": "955232320063090693", "name": "Eaglegon | AI × Chips", "username": "TheEaglegon"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118512149265887399", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj7inho3kbzimtn9vtar46d8d", "oldest_id": "2118436447892234519", "result_count": 25}}